ZkPassportMethodConstructorTest
├── when every argument is valid
│   ├── it should make the initial owner the pause holder
│   ├── it should make the initial admin the key admin
│   └── it should store the eight initial words in order
├── when the initial keys are seven
│   └── it should revert
├── when the initial keys are nine
│   └── it should revert
├── when any initial word but the guardian is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── when the initial guardian word is zero
│   └── it should deploy and store the zero word
├── when the initial version word is not canonical
│   └── it should revert
├── when the initial version word has only padding set
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should carry the version error, not the zero error
├── when every initial address word holds the largest address
│   └── it should deploy and store every word
└── when the initial version word is the highest release
    └── it should deploy and store the version word
